{'symbol': 'MGM', 'date': '2023-01-27 09:00:00', 'title': 'MGM RESORTS INTERNATIONAL AND THE NATIONAL FOOTBALL LEAGUE PLAYERS ASSOCIATION LAUNCH EVENTS AND HOSPITALITY PARTNERSHIP', 'text': 'MGM RESORTS & NFLPA TO COLLABORATE ON ORIGINAL CONTENT AND EVENTS LAS VEGAS , JAN. 27, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- MGM RESORTS INTERNATIONAL (NYSE: MGM) ANNOUNCED TODAY A MULTI-YEAR AGREEMENT TO BECOME A HOSPITALITY AND STRATEGIC PARTNER OF THE NATIONAL FOOTBALL LEAGUE PLAYERS ASSOCIATION (NFLPA). UNDER THE AGREEMENT, THE TWO SIDES WILL COLLABORATE ON CREATING NEW CONTENT AND FAN EXPERIENCES WITH CURRENT AND RETIRED NFL PLAYERS.'}